2. Anything you create with the Software. Data models, project files, shared
   links, images, PDFs, and generated code (such as Mongoose models,
   mongosh scripts and JSON Schema validators) belong to you, and you may use
   them, share them, and sell them without any restriction from this license.
3. Hosting the Software for free, for yourself, your team, your class, or the
   public, as long as you do not charge for access to it.
4. Teaching, writing, or making videos about the Software, even for money,
   as long as what is sold is your teaching and not the Software.

